# Lotus Field's trigger with fewer than two other lands (the 2019-07-12 ruling): Bot1 controls Forest and the Field, so
# both are sacrificed, the Field itself included (CR 701.21a: it is a land Bot1 controls), and Bot2's Island is not
# touched. Nothing is asked: with no more lands than the count, all are taken.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Lotus Field
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Lotus Field.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Lotus Field; Forest
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
